<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ reports NZ$2.0 mln trade deficit in March.</title>
<headline>NZ reports NZ$2.0 mln trade deficit in March.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Thursday released the following provisional statistics for New Zealand external merchandise trade for March.</p>
<p>(Figures are rounded, with revised-from data in brackets)</p>
<p>Monthly series:</p>
<p>		Mar 1997	    Feb 1997	     Mar 1996</p>
<p>Balance    -$2.0 million	  $160.5 million ($159.7)  $188.1 million</p>
<p>Exports     $1.75 billion     $1.67 bln	    $1.86 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $1.75 billion     $1.51 bln	    $1.67 bln</p>
<p>		Yr-to-Mar 1997    Yr-to-Feb 1997     Yr-to-Mar 1996</p>
<p>Balance    -498.2 million     -308.1 million (-$309.8)  -$999.5 bln</p>
<p>Exports     $20.75 bln	  $20.86 bln	   $20.39 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $21.25 bln	  $21.17 bln	   $21.39 bln</p>
<p>Trend series:</p>
<p>		Mar 1997	    Feb 1997	     Mar 1996</p>
<p>Balance    -$111.1 million	  -73.6 million	   -$110.2 million</p>
<p>Exports     $1.66 billion     $1.68 bln	    $1.69 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $1.77 billion     $1.75 bln	    $1.80 bln</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
